[00:00.00] I think a lot of recording artists generally are restricted, maybe by the fact that they only have one lead singer or that they have a particular style to follow.
[00:11.00] We've always been lucky in that we can change with any particular musical trend.
[00:16.00] And also we're not stuck with any one given set of people to perform on the records.
[00:22.00] I mean for instance on the song Breakdown on the iRobot album we go from the voice of Alan Clark to a thousand voices singing on a chorus at the end.
